ault"><div class="elementor-shortcode"><pre class="ti-widget" style="display: none"><template id="trustindex-google-widget-html"><div class=" ti-widget  ti-goog ti-review-text-mode-readmore ti-text-align-left" data-no-translation="true" data-time-locale="%d %s ago|today|day|days|week|weeks|month|months|year|years" data-plugin-version="13.3.2" data-layout-id="15" data-layout-category="slider" data-set-id="drop-shadow" data-pid="" data-language="en" data-close-locale="Close" data-review-target-width="300" data-css-version="2" data-reply-by-locale="Owner&apos;s reply" data-only-rating-locale="This user only left a rating." data-pager-autoplay-timeout="6"> <div class="ti-widget-container ti-col-3"> <div class="ti-reviews-container"> <div class="ti-controls"> <div class="ti-next" aria-label="Next review" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> <div class="ti-prev" aria-label="Previous review" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> </div> <div class="ti-reviews-container-wrapper">  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1787702400" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">I highly recommend Elite Bathrooms to my clients, family, and friends. They’ve already completed over 12 bathroom remodels from my referrals alone, and the experience has been amazing every single time.

Georgie is extremely professional, responsive, and communicative from beginning to end. He keeps everyone updated, shows up when he says he will, pays attention to the details, and most importantly, stands behind the quality of his work.

I own a home-service business myself, so my standards are very high when it comes to workmanship, customer service, cleanliness, and communication. Elite Bathrooms consistently meets those standards and delivers for every person I send their way.

It takes a lot for me to put my name behind another company, but I have no hesitation recommending Georgie and the Elite Bathrooms team. 5 stars all day.</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocINPeqLmGXTbL-1V0D9FajNNoanbR_xdYUHwHjdqpeQEg4R3w=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Randy Roa profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Randy Roa </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1787529600" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">We had such a great experience with Elite Bathrooms! From start to finish, the entire process was smooth, professional, and stress-free. Their communication was excellent, they showed up when they said they would, and the quality of their work exceeded our expectations.
They paid attention to every detail and truly cared about making sure we were happy with the finished result. Our bathroom turned out absolutely beautiful, and we couldn’t be happier. It’s refreshing to work with a company that takes so much pride in their work and customer service.
We would absolutely recommend Elite Bathrooms to anyone considering a bathroom remodel. Thank you for making the entire experience so easy and for giving us a bathroom we love!</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJPPydKsbPjy6XnOlysPsHL9HFjikSY37pZD8QAG4X7KudiRg=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Rebecca De Angelis profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Rebecca De Angelis </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1787529600" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">Absolutely amazing experience with Elite Bathroom The team was professional, reliable, and really paid attention to the details. Communication was easy throughout the process, the work was completed beautifully, and everything turned out even better than expected.

You can tell they take pride in what they do and genuinely care about their customers. If you’re looking for someone in the Tacoma area for a bathroom remodel or renovation, I definitely recommend Elite Bathroom. Great workmanship, great service, and a company I would happily use again!</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWs0cw0Di7yhprKiWOPDHuGJxVDLI_kpvg3t9uQ1ySrlkZBXlw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Galileo&apos;s Pizza profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Galileo's Pizza </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1787011200" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platfor