Thank you Gheorghe and his team for all the hard work. We are very pleased with our new bathroom and would definitely recommend Elite Bathrooms!</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJdr6A_4h6leWQpkbO_2HRqgP_dI7GR-YUptTmW43sJgPKpkA=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="John Reed profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> John Reed </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1786665600" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">We highly recommend Elite Bathrooms if you want quality workmanship, professionalism, honesty, reliability, and excellent communication.  We worked with Gheorghe and his team on remodeling 2 bathrooms and tile for our kitchen.  It is not every day you find a company that is passionate about what they do, highly skilled and take pride in the project from beginning to end.  They were responsible, showed up on time, worked late, honest, and listened to our needs and offered solutions that were superior.  We absolutely love the end result, definitely a WOW factor!  Our Custom Kitchen cabinet representative was so impressed with the tile work, and said "you can see the professionalism, craftsmanship, and detail in their work" and asked me for their contact information, which I was more than happy to share.  We look forward to working with Elite Bathrooms on projects with our other properties in the future.  Thank you to all of the great people at Elite Bathrooms!</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWpFAInKvTF6eOL9g7rWk8Qz3y2-KbI3_AY-o7s7mxBGdCMZGY=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Michelle Donaldson profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Michelle Donaldson </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1785369600" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">I don’t usually write reviews, but Elite Bathrooms truly deserves one. From the very first meeting, Gheorghe made us feel comfortable and never pressured us into anything. He took the time to answer all of our questions, explained the process, and helped us make the best decisions for our bathroom.

The entire team was respectful, hardworking, and treated our home like it was their own. They showed up when they said they would, kept everything clean, and the attention to detail was incredible. You can tell they genuinely care about the quality of their work.

Seeing our old bathroom transformed into such a beautiful space honestly exceeded our expectations. Every time we walk in, it feels like we’re in a luxury hotel. We couldn’t be happier with the result.

If you’re looking for a company you can trust to do things the right way, I highly recommend Elite Bathrooms. Thank you, Gheorghe and the team, for making this such a great experience!</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLkCO-7fuVmGv7Dqhn38vf065K2SFY35QfmvguuO-oAJ0aT_w=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Me Somethin profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Me Somethin </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1784073600" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">Had a wonderful experience working with this team, they are communicative, honest and professional. Not our cheapest choice but the great ones never are, you really get what you pay for and our tiling turned out better than I hoped! Would recommend to anyone doing bathroom renovations, we will absolutely have them back for any future projects!</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLDwBL8iex0Y01zHdPS8q06snwj-tK-hjo8pc2kcqsAUIVaJQ=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Haley Zayatz profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Haley Zayatz </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1783641600" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">Elite Bathroom exceeded my expectations from start to finish. Their pricing was very fair and competitive, especially considering the outstanding quality of the work. The team was professional, reliable, and paid attention to every little detail, making sure everything was done right the first time.

My bathroom looks absolutely amazing now—modern, stylish, and built with high-quality craftsmanship. They kept the work area clean, finished the project on schedule, and made the entire remodeling process stress-free. If you’re looking for excellent value, top-notch workmanship, and a company that truly cares about customer satisfaction, I highly recommend Elite Bathroom!</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2Kf2uzDhxjOoaPIJRAe3C8NLYKxy-UeiKrSAezbd7xPoIBFw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100" alt="Aurel Balan profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Aurel Balan </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1783036800" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><trustindex-image class="ti-star" data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">Gheorghe and his crew remodeled my small bathroom and the results are beautiful and functional. They gave me a very competitive bid,  showed up on time, worked very fast, and Gheorghe did his best to communicate clearly with me throughout the process. They will work very hard to give you the product you want! I was onsite for most of the remodel which was helpful to make small decisions during the job.</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <trustindex-image data-imgurl="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJXgCQn1EO3Xs81ebyTiLT4Ohc8d6VcdgPBGBZSJgh_om1_Tg=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" alt="Maribeth Spencer profile picture" loading="lazy"></trustindex-image> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Maribeth Spencer </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  </div> <div class="ti-controls-line"> <div class="dot"></div> </div> </div>    </div> </div> </template></pre><div data-src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/loader.js?wp-widget" data-tem