 is based only on my experience during the estimate and communication process. Communication was generally good, but I was disappointed with the overall customer experience. Some of the information and terms seemed to change during the process, which made it difficult for me to feel confident moving forward.</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Thumbtack</span> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/icon.svg" alt="Thumbtack" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-08.svg" srcset="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-08.svg 2x" alt="Samyol L. profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Samyol L. </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1779753600" class="ti-review-item source-Thumbtack ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Verified</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">Gheorghe reached out immediately to set up an appointment within a few days. The price was competitive and he was flexible to schedule the work around my travel schedule. The team that came out for the job were professional and punctual, and easy to communicate with. They stayed a little later than planned one day to get the job done on time. I’m very happy with how it came out and his team was a pleasure to work with with.</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Thumbtack</span> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/icon.svg" alt="Thumbtack" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-01.svg" srcset="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-01.svg 2x" alt="James C. profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> James C. </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1772668800" class="ti-review-item source-Thumbtack ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Verified</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">How often can you say that a renovation project ended up better than expected?  That’s how we feel about working with Gheorghe of Elite Tile &amp; Remodel and his team of incredible craftsman.  I’m a DIYer, and thought about doing some of the work on my own.  But seeing the results of the professional work that was done, I’m so glad I didn’t try.  Gheorghe is fair, transparent, and just simply knows what he’s doing.  We’re so excited we finally have our dream bathroom!</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Thumbtack</span> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/icon.svg" alt="Thumbtack" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-05.svg" srcset="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-05.svg 2x" alt="Mike G. profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Mike G. </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1766188800" class="ti-review-item source-Thumbtack ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Verified</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">The team from Elite tile were great to work with. Prompt, fast, and with precision for our tile work around the fireplace. Highly recommend and will be contacting them again for a future bathroom renovation.</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Thumbtack</span> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/icon.svg" alt="Thumbtack" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-10.svg" srcset="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-10.svg 2x" alt="Pam K. profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Pam K. </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1761782400" class="ti-review-item source-Thumbtack ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Verified</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">Super quick and efficient.  Job was done professionally with attention to detail and cleanliness.</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Thumbtack</span> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/icon.svg" alt="Thumbtack" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-10.svg" srcset="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-10.svg 2x" alt="Chris C. profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Chris C. </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1752624000" class="ti-review-item source-Thumbtack ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Verified</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">Overall, Gheorghe and his team were great. We had a few hiccups along the way, normal for any construction project, but I was impressed by their work. The detail in the tiling was wonderful. I drew the design and they executed it precisely the way I asked them to. I used granite, sub tile, hexagonal tile and liner black and white tile. I also used epoxy grout. Please remember that if you use epoxy grout you need to remove the haze within 24 hours or it sets like stone. Once it's set, you have to use a special product to remove it. You have to remove it in small sections, by hand, on your knees. It takes about eight hours, unless you get the haze off of the tile within that 24 hour period. I recommend not waiting! That stuff drives really quickly. Other than that, they did beautiful work and I love my bathroom! Every time I look at it I marvel at how they executed my design and did the math so that even the tiny tiles are symmetrically cut. Thank you, Gheorghe and team!</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Thumbtack</span> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/icon.svg" alt="Thumbtack" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-10.svg" srcset="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-10.svg 2x" alt="Andrea H. profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Andrea H. </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1747958400" class="ti-review-item source-Thumbtack ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Verified</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">Extremely fast and excellent work re-tiling our fireplace. This was the most painless home improvement project I’ve hired for. Highly recommend!</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Thumbtack</span> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/icon.svg" alt="Thumbtack" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-06.svg" srcset="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-06.svg 2x" alt="Suryn D. profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Suryn D. </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1746921600" class="ti-review-item source-Thumbtack ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Verified</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">Thanks for the perfect refresh for my 2.5 bathrooms!! I love being in them every single day! Gheorghe and his team were easy to work with and Gheorghe was very responsive to any questions or issues. He was respectful of our budget needs and worked with me as I purchased most of the materials. He &amp; his team finished everything in a timely manner and I absolutely love the result. Thanks again!!</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Thumbtack</span> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/icon.svg" alt="Thumbtack" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-08.svg" srcset="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-08.svg 2x" alt="Martha W. profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Martha W. </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1743465600" class="ti-review-item source-Thumbtack ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Verified</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">They showed up on time, worked hard, were very knowledgeable and professional; responded quickly to my texts and calls, and stuck to their estimate. They also cleaned up nicely after their work. The job was to install a new bathtub surround and shower where there used to be laminate and no shower.</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Thumbtack</span> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/icon.svg" alt="Thumbtack" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-07.svg" srcset="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/default-avatar/noprofile-07.svg 2x" alt="Grace C. profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Grace C. </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1740614400" class="ti-review-item source-Thumbtack ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-content"> <span class="ti-stars"><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Thumbtack/star/f.svg" alt="Thumbtack star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Verified</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-text">I had a fantastic experience with Elite Tile for my bathroom renovation! Their communication was excellent—they kept me informed every step of the way and were always quick to respond to any questions. They were punctual every day, which we really appreciated, and their attention to detail was outstanding. The tile work was done flawlessly, and the finished bathroom looks incredible.</div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-text" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div